---
/**
 * App/agent → cloud provider API → frontier model → tools/loop.
 * Labels carry meaning; color is secondary.
 */
---

<figure class="diagram">
  <figcaption class="diagram__caption">
    <span class="mono-label">Diagram</span>
    How an agentic app reaches a frontier model on a cloud provider
  </figcaption>
  <div class="diagram__frame">
    <svg
      class="diagram__svg"
      viewBox="0 0 660 280"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="cloud-agent-title cloud-agent-desc"
    >
      <title id="cloud-agent-title">Cloud provider access for agentic apps</title>
      <desc id="cloud-agent-desc">
        Flow from left to right: your app or agent sends a request to a cloud provider API such as
        Bedrock, Azure OpenAI, or Vertex. The provider forwards work to a frontier model. The model
        may call tools in a loop, then return a result to the app. A dashed arrow from tools back to
        the agent shows the observe-and-loop path.
      </desc>

      <rect x="12" y="20" width="636" height="240" rx="4" fill="var(--surface-quiet)" stroke="var(--rule)" />

      <!-- 1 App / agent -->
      <g transform="translate(28, 56)">
        <rect width="120" height="72" rx="3" fill="var(--teal-soft)" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="12" y="24" class="diagram-num" fill="var(--brand)">1</text>
        <text x="12" y="44" class="diagram-label" fill="var(--ink)">Your app</text>
        <text x="12" y="62" class="diagram-hint" fill="var(--ink)">or agent</text>
      </g>
      <path d="M156 92 H188" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow-cloud)" />

      <!-- 2 Provider API -->
      <g transform="translate(196, 56)">
        <rect width="140" height="72" rx="3" fill="var(--cobalt-soft)" stroke="var(--action)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="12" y="24" class="diagram-num" fill="var(--action)">2</text>
        <text x="12" y="44" class="diagram-label" fill="var(--ink)">Provider API</text>
        <text x="12" y="62" class="diagram-hint" fill="var(--ink)">Bedrock / peers</text>
      </g>
      <path d="M344 92 H376" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow-cloud)" />

      <!-- 3 Model -->
      <g transform="translate(384, 56)">
        <rect width="120" height="72" rx="3" fill="var(--mist-deep)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.25" />
        <text x="12" y="24" class="diagram-num" fill="var(--ink)">3</text>
        <text x="12" y="44" class="diagram-label" fill="var(--ink)">Frontier</text>
        <text x="12" y="62" class="diagram-hint" fill="var(--ink)">model</text>
      </g>
      <path d="M512 92 H544" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow-cloud)" />

      <!-- 4 Tools -->
      <g transform="translate(552, 56)">
        <rect width="80" height="72" rx="3" fill="var(--cobalt-soft)" stroke="var(--action)" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <text x="12" y="24" class="diagram-num" fill="var(--action)">4</text>
        <text x="12" y="44" class="diagram-label" fill="var(--ink)">Tools</text>
        <text x="12" y="62" class="diagram-hint" fill="var(--ink)">optional</text>
      </g>

      <!-- loop back -->
      <path
        class="cloud-loop-path"
        d="M592 128 V188 H88 V128"
        fill="none"
        stroke="var(--brand)"
        stroke-width="1.75"
        stroke-dasharray="5 4"
        marker-end="url(#arrow-cloud-brand)"
      />
      <circle class="cloud-loop-runner" r="3.5" fill="var(--action)" fill-opacity="0.75" />
      <text x="220" y="178" class="diagram-hint" fill="var(--brand)">observe → loop (agentic)</text>

      <!-- access note -->
      <text x="28" y="236" class="diagram-hint" fill="var(--ink)">
        Access: console chat · API keys/SDK · or cloud IAM roles (who may call which model)
      </text>

      <defs>
        <marker id="arrow-cloud" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto">
          <path d="M0,0 L6,3 L0,6" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.25" />
        </marker>
        <marker id="arrow-cloud-brand" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto">
          <path d="M0,0 L6,3 L0,6" fill="none" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="1.25" />
        </marker>
      </defs>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <p class="diagram__legend">
    Solid arrows = request path (numbered). Dashed teal path = agentic loop back to the app — same
    idea as the{' '}
    <a href="/learn/foundations/agentic-workflows">agentic workflow</a> lesson.
  </p>
</figure>

<style>
  .cloud-loop-path {
    animation: cloud-loop-dash 5s linear infinite;
  }
  .cloud-loop-runner {
    offset-path: path('M592 128 V188 H88 V128');
    offset-rotate: 0deg;
    animation: cloud-loop-run 5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes cloud-loop-dash {
    to {
      stroke-dashoffset: -40;
    }
  }
  @keyframes cloud-loop-run {
    0% {
      offset-distance: 0%;
      opacity: 0;
    }
    12% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    88% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    100% {
      offset-distance: 100%;
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .cloud-loop-path,
    .cloud-loop-runner {
      animation: none !important;
    }
    .cloud-loop-runner {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
